WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:15.106
The bunnies were sad.

2
00:00:15.107 --> 00:00:18.353
All the candy was gone.

3
00:00:18.354 --> 00:00:21.976
The mouse's boot was stuck.

4
00:00:21.977 --> 00:00:25.613
"We must tell the mouse," Benjamin said.

5
00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:30.120
"She will be mad," Peter said.

6
00:00:30.121 --> 00:00:33.669
"Look! Here she comes."

7
00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.314
The mouse ran toward the bunnies.

8
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:41.293
Suddenly she stopped.

9
00:00:41.294 --> 00:00:44.123
"My boot!"

10
00:00:44.124 --> 00:00:48.915
The mouse gasped.

11
00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:53.761
"Did someone paint a picture on my boot?"

12
00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:56.602
"Yes," Benjamin said.

13
00:00:56.603 --> 00:01:04.085
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle painted a picture on your boot."

14
00:01:04.086 --> 00:01:08.028
The mouse looked inside the boot.

15
00:01:08.029 --> 00:01:12.317
"Did someone put feathers in my boot?"

16
00:01:12.318 --> 00:01:15.144
"Yes," Peter said.

17
00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:19.001
"Jemima put feathers in your boot."

18
00:01:19.002 --> 00:01:21.459
The mouse looked at the rocks.

19
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:26.373
"Did someone get my boot stuck?"

20
00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:29.830
"Yes," Benjamin said sadly.

21
00:01:29.831 --> 00:01:39.366
"And we can't get it out."

22
00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:45.168
The mouse laughed.

23
00:01:45.169 --> 00:01:51.005
"Now my boot is pretty. My bed is soft.

24
00:01:51.006 --> 00:01:55.086
And nobody can take my boot!"

25
00:01:55.087 --> 00:02:00.858
Peter and Benjamin laughed too.

26
00:02:00.859 --> 00:02:05.478
"Thank you for finding my house," the mouse said.

27
00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:11.892
"I found something for you too."

28
00:02:11.893 --> 00:02:23.133
The mouse held out their candy!
